ry-based filters that do not require additional visual elements."}]},"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The catalog of all components provided by MISO. It contains also "},{"code":"View","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" extensions and "},{"code":"ViewModifiers","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" to apply tokens and styles on components and higher-level views."}],"url":"\/documentation\/misocomponents","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents","images":[{"identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png","type":"icon"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"Components","role":"collection","type":"topic"}}}